# .chezmoiignore – global ignores (patterns match TARGET paths, not source paths)
# See https://www.chezmoi.io/reference/special-files/chezmoiignore/
# This file itself is a template; `#` starts a comment (must be preceded by whitespace if not at line start).

# --- VCS internals: never version nested repos (e.g. quickshell/.git, kitty-themes/.git) ---
**/.git
**/.git/**

# --- Node.js: reinstall via package.json / bun.lock, never vendor ---
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**

# --- Python caches ---
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache/**

# --- Rust / Cargo build outputs ---
**/target
**/target/**

# --- Virtualenvs ---
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/venv
**/venv/**

# --- Editors / OS / backups ---
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/*.bak

# --- Local databases (desktop-context collector activity DB + SQLite sidecars/locks) ---
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db.lock

# --- Rich Black desktop theme: build artifacts + volatile state, never managed ---
# Generated by desktop-theme/generate.py (recreated every apply by run_10_generate-theme.sh):
**/gtk-3.0/colors.css
**/gtk-4.0/colors.css
**/qt6ct/colors/**
**/qt6ct/qss/**
# LibreOffice volatile config (patched in place by run_20..., never copied):
**/registrymodifications.xcu*
# GNOME gsettings state saved by apply-gnome.sh:
**/*.previous
